@9:30 _without training_ Close but *_No Cigar..._*
Quite apart from the *somatic* information and rules, *Optimus* still has to be taught _the first time_ how to behave in a given context. That takes a *_Dojo._*
The Dojo then uses a carefully constructed suite of approximate contexts, extracts/chooses the most likely correct behavior, downloads them to all/some robots that can use the new behavior and then the specific *Optimus primes* can use the behavior, (while observing in shadow mode.)

What will kill combustion vehicles *quickly* is:

*1)* when it is difficult to buy petroleum fuel, as stations close down; 
*2)* the price of EVs is at least equal to a combustion car to buy;

Number *2)* is here.
.

